											</tr>
											<tr>
												<td>
												<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="contentRegion" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px">
													
														<tr>
															<td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-bottom: 8px;"><font>Hi&nbsp;</font>CLIENT CONTACT,</td>
														</tr>
													
												</table>
												</td>
											</tr>
										
									</table>
									</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>

						<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="background-color:;" width="100%">
							
								<tr valign="top">
									<td class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block" width="100%">
									<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
										
											<tr>
												<td>
												<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="contentRegion" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px">
													
														<tr>
															<td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;">
															<div style="text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:arial"><font>I want to take a moment to thank you for the opportunity to serve as your Insperity Onboarding Specialist. I know the transition process can feel overwhelming at times and I hope we have made you feel at ease throughout. In order to make sure we are providing the highest level of service possible, we will be sending you a brief survey and I would love to hear your feedback.</font></span></span></span></div>

															<div style="text-align:left">&nbsp;</div>

															<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:arial">Now that your transition is complete, your dedicated Insperity&nbsp;</span></span></span><font><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:arial"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:#000000">Client Liaison/</span></span></span></span></font><span style="font-size:12pt"><font style=""><span style="text-align: start;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#000000" face="arial">HR Specialist&nbsp;</font></span></span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">is ready to serve as your main point of contact and will reach out to schedule a welcome and introduction call. If you need assistance sooner or have any questions, outside of payroll, please direct them to:</span></span></div>

															<div style="text-align:left">&nbsp;</div>

															<div style="text-align:center"><br />
															<br />
															<font><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:arial">Once again, it has been a pleasure to serve you and I wish you all the best!</span></span></span></font></div>
															</td>
														</tr>
													
												</table>
												</td>
											</tr>
										
									</table>
									</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>

